{"title":"Career Roadmap: Vertical Farm Technician","role":"Vertical Farm Technician","summary":"Career Domain: Agriculture, Food & Life Sciences · Qualification Pathway: B.Sc – Natural Farming / Vertical Farming / Hydroponics · Target Career: Vertical Farm Technician","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Hons) Agriculture and Allied","Course":"Natural Farming / Vertical Farming / Hydroponics"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Vertical Farm Technician keeps indoor vertical farms running - LED lighting, nutrient systems, sensors and crop care - so stacked trays of greens grow evenly all year."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Vertical Farm Technician does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Monitor and adjust nutrients, lighting and climate"},{"text":"Seed, transplant and harvest crops"},{"text":"Maintain pumps, sensors and lights"},{"text":"Record crop and system data"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vertical-farming companies"},{"text":"Agri-tech start-ups"},{"text":"Research farms"},{"text":"Retail and hotel farms"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Technician"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Senior Technician"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Grower / Supervisor"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Farm Manager"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Operations Head"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Basics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plant science"},{"text":"Basic electrical and electronics"},{"text":"Home hydroponics project"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2: Systems"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hydroponics and LED lighting"},{"text":"Sensors and automation"},{"text":"Hygiene and food safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3: Experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Intern at a vertical farm"},{"text":"Learn maintenance routines"},{"text":"Learn data logging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4: Placement"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RAWE / ELP at an indoor farm"},{"text":"Project on energy or yield"},{"text":"Apply to vertical farms"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Hydroponics"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"LED and climate systems"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Maintenance"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Data recording"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Attention to detail"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Teamwork"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensors and controllers"},{"text":"pH / EC meters"},{"text":"Maintenance tools"},{"text":"Dashboards"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vertical farms"},{"text":"Agri-tech start-ups"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hydroponics courses"},{"text":"Basic electrical safety"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc Horticulture / Protected Cultivation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Entrance exams and tests to know:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"I